# Baseline B-08 (negotiation-8): the range 4.5 down to 4.4 (00 01 05 04)
# covers 4.4, so it is answered 00 00 04 04, and the connection then
# serves a session: HELLO succeeds (ADR-0303). The leading C: <RAW> is the
# script's own handshake, so there is no automatic one and no
# !: AUTO HELLO.
!: AUTO GOODBYE

C: <RAW> 60 60 B0 17 00 01 05 04 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
S: <RAW> 00 00 04 04
C: HELLO {"user_agent": "relate-bolt-compat/1.0", "scheme": "none"}
S: SUCCESS {}
